  "notes": [
    "One attacker (0x190cd736) drained the byte-equivalent LockedDeal deployments on Polygon first, then Ethereum and BSC within 7 minutes; copycats and MEV bots repeated it on BSC and Ethereum over the next two hours. No overflowing create appears on any of the three before the attacker's.",
    "The attacker's tokens are valued at realised proceeds: BNB per token on BSC (as previously derived), ETH from 1inch/Uniswap sales on Ethereum, WETH for MEE on Polygon. Tokens it never sold (ESNC, 182k ETH POOLZ, PORTX) count zero. Copycats' POOLZ is valued at the attacker's unit price, other copycat tokens at DefiLlama, or zero where unpriced."
  ]
